[[0,20566,0,2,0,2,"2014-07-22T13:40:00","Nameless","",[],"<p>Pretty much as the title says.</p>\n<p>I have just over 2,785 prompts saved for those times when I feel like writing. While the actual number does exceed the 3k mark, knowing this boggles my mind because that means I have completed less than 2% of the entire total.</p>\n<p>I think I'm going to be stuck here for a very, very long time..</p>","[OT] TIL - I have over 2,785 prompts saved for writing.. and that's only including the ones I know of.","","writingprompts"],[1,19689,0,1,0,1,"2014-07-23T08:48:00","fae","",[],"<p>That's quite a collection of prompts! Where did you source them from?</p>"],[2,19812,19689,1,0,1,"2014-07-24T06:02:00","Nameless","",[],"<p>I've sourced them from various blogs, deviantart submissions, PDF's and a book. A few were even culled from reddit.</p>\n<p>Surprisingly, very few (if any) of the prompts were generated from 'content generators' devoted to such things.</p>"]]
[]
